      "abstract": "In order to gain a clearer understanding of community-driven standardization efforts and how NIH might best<br>relate to them, BD2K held a workshop on Frameworks for Community-based Standards Efforts in<br>September 2013. This report - authored by the lead organizers and co-chairs of this workshop - elaborate on the findings,<br>indicating directions that would help move forward the BD2K vision to allow data and other digital<br>research products to interact and work with each other.",
